{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32642","headline":"题四皓庙 · 刘沧","name":"题四皓庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石壁苍苔翠霭浓，驱车商洛想遗踪。\n天高猨呌向山月，露下鹤声来庙松。\n叶堕阴岩疎薜荔，池经秋雨老芙蓉。\n雪髯仙侣何深隐，千古寂寥云水重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32642.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32642","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}